===Etymology 1===
From {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{term|halle|lang=gmh}}, from {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|halla|lang=goh}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{recons|hallō|lang=gem-pro}}, ultimately from {{etyl|ine-pro|de}} {{recons|ḱel-||to hide, cover, conceal|lang=ine-pro}}. Compare Low German {{term|Hall|lang=nds}}, Dutch {{term|hal|lang=nl}}, English {{term|hall|lang=en}}, Danish and Swedish {{term|hall|lang=sv}}.

